## Inherited Capabilities

- Complete baseline from `docs/BASELINE_TOOL_SPEC.md`
- Per-user BYOK and account isolation
- Provider profiles with base URL, model, key, compatibility mode, and connection parsing
- Model discovery where supported
- Product-local provider/model pool
